    <body>
        <p MadCap:conditions="Default.Cloud">On <MadCap:variable name="General.ProductName"/> Cloud, requests to this endpoint are rate limited for each organization. When you reach the limit, the server responds with HTTP status 429 and a <code>retry-after</code> value.</p>
    </body>
</html>
